polyitemless, genoless, and wishless at the same time.  So I decided
to up the challenge a bit this time and throw polyselfless and
illiterate into the mix.  And do it with a cavewoman, which is a
pretty weak class.  I'm running into some unique challenges that I
haven't hit before.

